              "text": "die Konzentration — \"concentration\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Nach zwei Stunden lässt meine Konzentration nach. After two hours my concentration fades."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "No plural in this sense. Nachlassen — to ease off, to fade."
