              "text": "die Wiederholung — \"the revision (for an exam); the repetition\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Vor der Klausur machen wir eine Wiederholung des ganzen Stoffes. Before the exam we revise all the material."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural: die Wiederholungen. From wiederholen — to repeat, to revise. On television, die Wiederholung is a repeat."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Wiederholung is formed from wiederholen with -ung (EtymDB); the verb joins wieder \"again\" to holen \"to fetch\", from Middle High German holen (EtymDB): you fetch the material again."
            }
          ]
        },
